Privacy Policy for PompierMES
Effective date: May 9, 2026
Contact: 

stanislas.sekelj@gmail.com

Overview
PompierMES is a tactical scenario editor for firefighter training. The app operates entirely offline — no data is collected, stored on external servers, or shared with any third party.

Permissions Used
Camera
The app requests camera access solely to capture photos of real scenes for use as scenario backgrounds within the app. Photos are stored locally on your device only and are never uploaded or transmitted.

Storage / Photos
Captured photos and scenario data are saved locally on your device. No files are shared externally.

Data Collection
PompierMES does not collect, transmit, or share any personally identifiable information. No analytics, advertising SDKs, or tracking libraries are included.

Data Storage
All app data (scenarios, settings, language preference) is stored locally on the device using an on-device database. Uninstalling the app removes all associated data.

Children's Privacy
This app does not knowingly collect data from anyone, including children.

Changes
Any future updates to this policy will be noted with a new effective date in the app listing.

